**How it runs**

- Roam: install the runner extension by URL (`https://discoursegraphs.com/releases/prototypes/proof-runner/`), open the kit page, press Run.
- Obsidian: `node obsidian/dist/cli.mjs --kit k.json --worktree <dg worktree> --marker <str> [--pause failure] [--pace 1]` (`obsidian/cli.ts:2-4`), driving Obsidian over CDP.

**What it outputs** — `obsidian/cli.ts` `runOnce()` writes into `<worktree>/local/proof-kit/<branch>/<kit>-<timestamp>/`:
- `result.md` — the PR comment
- `kit-report.md` — fixes needed in the kit itself
- `records.json` — per-case records
- `journal.jsonl`, `added-cases.jsonl`
- `screenshots/` (the `screenshot` action)

